# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Playwright smoke-test screenshots -- artefacts for the owner to look at,
# never assertions, and never committed.
tests/out/
# Playwright's own run bookkeeping (traces, .last-run.json), separate from
# tests/out/ above.
test-results/

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# Python bytecode from the Blender build scripts
tools/__pycache__/

# Agent worktrees. Real git worktrees of this same repo, never content.
.claude/worktrees/

# Art the game does not load.
#
# The bundle imports exactly three files out of assets/ -- the .glb and the two
# .webp illustrations -- and everything else in there is authoring material that
# belongs on the owner's disk rather than in every clone.

# The authored PNGs the shipped illustrations were made from: 2.5 MB each
# against the ~130 KB the game actually loads. Keep them locally; they are what
# a different crop or a larger size would be re-cut from.
assets/Illustrations/masters/

# Preview renders. tools/build_ship.py writes all three on every run, so they
# are build output in the same sense dist/ is.
assets/pirateship_beginner_preview.png
assets/pirateship_beginner_side.png
assets/pirateship_beginner_detail.png
